  "contractNotes1317": "13/10/2026 (#1317): the stats band (.bg-dark) and the footer kept their grey words (#999, #555: 56 of the left paints) while their ground followed, so the page followed 60-76% under BMW, Stripe and Moxie; both repaint their words with the system text (text-2 for the subjects and descriptions). Carousel indicators, owl pagination and the feature icons follow too. Round 4 (14/10): the owl pagination dots and the feature icon rings are painted on their inner span (.owl-page span, .font-icon span, .ft-bottom .icon span), not on the element the round-3 rules named, so those rules never landed; they now name the span.",
